WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.889
On West Gate Portal, open Users & Access -> Federation Tokens and mint a scoped oscar_fed_ service token.

2
00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:09.981
On Central HQ Node, open Servers in Federation Token mode (HTTPS 443), paste the token, and connect West Gate Portal.

3
00:00:10.021 --> 00:00:32.702
Search Events for container CLDU 962674-9 and click Compare Passes to inspect transits, OCR crops, and waveforms from both nodes.

4
00:00:32.742 --> 00:00:45.883
In Report Generator, select Vehicle Incident with Include Federated Servers enabled and generate unified JSON and PDF reports across both nodes.
